 drivers/leds/Kconfig         |  11 ++
 drivers/leds/Makefile        |   1 +
 drivers/leds/leds-qnap-mcu.c | 227 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 240 insertions(+)
